{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "05ad67171e58c281b058afb26c448d2d93ba0169e803e654f80cffa1a3ef2f1d", "ja": "友達の証", "zh": "朋友的证明", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4e9d34949af6e16c335a4a9c7287e50aa1b917c49a1fed184c3bb889eb635a15", "ja": "放課後の街で百合子から声を掛けられ、\n「風紀委員を呼ぶ」と言う杏奈。百合子は\n昨日のお礼を言い、「友達になりたい」と\n告げる。ふたりがクレープを食べに行こうと\nしたところで、ブザーが鳴る。", "zh": "放学后的街道上，百合子主动向杏奈搭话，  \n杏奈说要“叫风纪委员来”。百合子向她道谢，  \n并告诉她“想和你成为朋友”。两人正要一起去  \n吃可丽饼时，蜂鸣器响了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "fb556db8c9bf97c0f8f5fbddf38fe448e79f34e5ca5bd9fa451073f100575c07", "ja": "キーンコーン、カーンコーン……", "zh": "叮铃铃、叮铃铃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "80f4942274c0fa00dee5f23382fa521c971bbe01621336300b846080026fd10c", "ja": "（……学校は、きらい。……勉強も、苦手。\n引っ込み思案……だし。人見知り、だし……）", "zh": "（……我讨厌学校。……也不擅长学习。\n又内向……又怕生……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1002_joshiseitoa", "source_sha256": "823031d1d4d8e6458923ff02cf8a87ad5e1547ec6af15acd9bd6a43a247843c8", "ja": "ねえねえ、今日どっか寄って帰らない？", "zh": "喂喂，今天要不要顺路去哪里逛逛再回去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1003_joshiseitob", "source_sha256": "13d339df13b21fd3c835a11635bf2ab12cde92dbf163d323d84b9494b34301d1", "ja": "いいよー！　じゃあクレープたべよ♪", "zh": "好呀——！那就吃可丽饼吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "b07e64782b01b0433cab9801e90f55badbb7b4012e12208a488e279703263258", "ja": "（杏奈……友達も、いないし。\nだから……早く、陰の世界にならない、かな……）", "zh": "（杏奈……也没有朋友。\n所以……要是能快点变成阴暗世界就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "b3b5e62939d352ca0cca82b86b681c3fa92d095a9b0b6f72ca81f74554594fd9", "ja": "（陰の世界、なら……杏奈は、ヒーローになれる……。\nたぶん、陽より陰が合ってる……陰キャ、だから？）", "zh": "（要是阴影世界的话……杏奈就能成为英雄……。\n大概，比起阳光，阴影更适合杏奈……因为是阴角？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "40155d70ad8a81d1616aa2d30fa4eef0c37bf3e4ec8c3fcc23186654c8516e3b", "ja": "ぴったり、だね……ふふふ……。", "zh": "很合适呢……呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ffdb780d466707cc7cf9cbac0f4d00ee4fe3d0fa7ab6f845c94ac79fcafa8ac", "ja": "（……陽の世界にいても……面白いこと、ない……。\n楽しいのは……ゲームしてる時、くらい……？）", "zh": "（……即使身处阳光的世界……也没有什么有趣的事……\n开心的时候……也就只有玩游戏的时候……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "171f603aebc6930a900a9b81940f9c532c62b229aac437b0bcafe02f37dc9bff", "ja": "（どうして……陰の世界の、こと……\n陽の世界に、持ち込んじゃいけないの……かな……）", "zh": "（为什么……不能把阴暗世界的事情……\n带到阳光世界来……呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "1842fb655a2ef4d2d34725a89cefa9d79497cbf2065cd7559537a5e6b5d32540", "ja": "あ、あの……！", "zh": "啊，那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "8c13a124a12a0c10462ac5b03374092824f7a44e066b3e6c071f391ee7165417", "ja": "（陽の世界は……明るいけど、寂しい……。\nずっと……ひとりぼっち、だし）", "zh": "（阳光世界……虽然很明亮，却很寂寞……。\n一直……都是孤零零的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "ec0cbac57204ef412bb7c0f2a7f57b5feca238f613141a5019a68f10c1a6ffd2", "ja": "（シャドウバウトを続けてたら……いつか、\n見つかるのかな。……杏奈だけの、居場所……）", "zh": "（如果继续进行暗影决斗……总有一天，\n能找到吗……只属于杏奈的容身之处……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "bcb72321ffe280826b19093b6259d09b351034ef2f833f2785f2267e3d08df68", "ja": "あ、あのっ！　えっと……もしもし！", "zh": "啊、那个！呃……喂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "b87e1a8aa29f4cca0d2d5b85188f7a3c7213accd02e11783b98b2b7b505f132c", "ja": "！？　あ……き、昨日の……。", "zh": "！？啊……是、是昨天的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "79cff7dc2258ef9506934ae295d686e711919b329a5ac67860980903b09a3a66", "ja": "はいっ、百合子です！\n杏奈ちゃん……だよね？", "zh": "是的，我是百合子！\n你是杏奈……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "e43d3815477487f01a7f86b217f69a7ea3e127339893cb309f7e72bdc47130d9", "ja": "……陽の世界なのに……杏奈を、殺しにきた、の……？\n風紀委員、呼びます……。", "zh": "……明明是在表世界……你却要来、杀了杏奈、吗……？\n我要叫、风纪委员了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "7fec819dbf7192e9ae55df757409abb19231f764821b02967f922b616622a9a1", "ja": "ま、待って！　違うの！\nえっと……昨日は、助けてくれてありがとうっ！", "zh": "等、等等！不是那样的！\n那个……昨天谢谢你救了我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "488f20229385c9c4439982d66330bf7449b780e7c7a1fc057a9c2be11c75e203", "ja": "それだけ、どうしても言いたくて……\n杏奈ちゃんみたいな人に、私ずっと憧れてたの。", "zh": "我只是无论如何都想把这句话说出来……\n我一直憧憬着像杏奈那样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "c99d863145f38d2d1d96a873bac5cff605bb2608635ed584972a7da9cb9fa683", "ja": "誰かを助けられるヒーローみたいな、\n強くて優しい女の子。", "zh": "像英雄一样，能够帮助他人，\n坚强又温柔的女孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "4dba5cac610472d23bd0572f053b1b13e53302b6952ffb0361736a97f8d14754", "ja": "強くて、優しい……？\n……杏奈が？", "zh": "坚强……又温柔……？\n……杏奈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "b3e72b5f4bff8621147b9b53afb70067ac700e232c1fb9d1e932286cbf57b5b3", "ja": "杏奈は……そんなんじゃ、ない、です……。\nだって陰キャ、だし……見て、わかるでしょ……？", "zh": "杏奈……才不是那样……的……  \n因为我是阴角嘛……看就知道了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "93a84a8b69c7f3117b836e5d69fe9d329f49e31fc5ff18735cfc41d8d4184b8a", "ja": "ううん！　昨日の杏奈ちゃん、すごくかっこよかった！\nずっと見てたよ、目が離せなかった！", "zh": "才没有呢！昨天的杏奈，非常帅气哦！\n我一直在看着你，完全移不开视线！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "69da075506b2ba40226b57cb44c961f88ca1f3cd3fb19736d4eebd788ce8e86c", "ja": "……。でも……幻滅、した……よね。\n陽の世界だと、杏奈……こんな、だから……。", "zh": "……。但是……你很失望……吧。\n在现实的世界里，杏奈……是这个样子的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "1e11166519d2652cb4a7d63b8b0fe07f0af2eab1766e79c0e45fdce46a3089e1", "ja": "ううん！　杏奈ちゃんは杏奈ちゃんだよ！\n私……杏奈ちゃんと、友達になりたいの！", "zh": "不是的！杏奈就是杏奈呀！\n我……想和杏奈成为朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "bf03580e6835d0ea49f3901e65f41ee6daf1c5cd8bcf9c4b7193a4bd617bb485", "ja": "それに、私もどっちかっていうと\n陰キャ寄りっていうか……はは。", "zh": "而且，我也算是比较偏阴沉的那一类吧……哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "bb8ebed78329929dec08c67ad74bb61ae2d70f389595ccd4d82196c84a943bc0", "ja": "とも、だち……。", "zh": "朋、朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "37dccd2f2c4d230eab3242793409d3c4b7398108524069d8b0c448044228a242", "ja": "うん。い、いきなりだと、困るかな？\nごめんね、私も友達少ないから……。", "zh": "嗯。如果、如果突然这样，会不会让你为难？\n对不起，我的朋友也很少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "4ed92704c2a42e3f4fdee5c310afce667889f937542e2c880e9978779873630e", "ja": "だから、どうやって友達作るのか、\nよくわからなくて……その……。", "zh": "所以，我也不太清楚该怎么交朋友……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "90fca5abc99345df5b18f1f1dcb48080b23f26668f9378fd8e6309d6691a53e1", "ja": "……クレープ。", "zh": "……可丽饼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "61545749bdc900b4ff93ccbd633d7e79bc24d220fdc99490eb33040c295937de", "ja": "友達って……一緒にクレープ、食べるみたい……。\nえっと……だから……。", "zh": "朋友……就是要一起吃可丽饼的样子……。\n那个……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "9a6b7c966d93e303e6ca48a9ac6f2ace821d31c3e2869e246eea0bd29d5f04f3", "ja": "うん！\nそれじゃあ、これから一緒に食べに行こう！", "zh": "嗯！\n那我们现在一起去吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0394_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0394_story_05_1033_se", "source_sha256": "a7c55e1fc0169ea4782244a3ef1a2807ecc7877fe66fa71b0c58901f6d3c59f1", "ja": "ブーーーーーーーーーッ！", "zh": "呜————————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
